  "notes": "{増|ふ}やす means to increase something in number or amount.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: {他動詞|たどうし} (transitive)\n- Pair: {増|ふ}える (intransitive - to increase by itself)\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {人数|にんずう}を{増|ふ}やす: to increase the number of people\n- {貯金|ちょきん}を{増|ふ}やす: to increase savings\n- {売|う}り{上|あ}げを{増|ふ}やす: to increase sales\n- {仲間|なかま}を{増|ふ}やす: to increase one's companions\n- {語彙|ごい}を{増|ふ}やす: to increase vocabulary\n\nCONTRAST WITH SIMILAR VERBS:\n- {増|ふ}やす: to increase (quantity, number)\n- {加|くわ}える: to add (to a group)\n- {足|た}す: to add (math, supplement)",
